                                                "example_id": "d68d6356-5a85-483e-8672-d2fb3cf71c1d",
                                                "sense_id": "d69d5a59-8d4d-326f-8ec0-03950c9cbbde",
                                                "text": "When Lazarus left his charnel-cave,\n⁠And home to Mary’s house return’d,\n⁠Was this demanded—if he yearn’d\nTo hear her weeping by his grave?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13652af6-1155-3076-8f6a-b3b29cea0969",
                                        "entry_id": "695064f1-6ff1-304f-8b37-e1807af3dbe7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To require of someone."
